  152|       |     * The issue is that while s1 and s2 are small-range numbers, (s1 + 2^256 - 1) / 2 (mod n)
  153|       |     * and (s2 + 2^256 - 1) / 2 (mod n) are not, undoing the benefit of the splitting.
